type: software
title: "Minimal Hyperbolic Micromagnetics"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Adams
    given-names: Michael P.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9269-8087"
abstract: >-
  Minimal Hyperbolic Micromagnetics is a reduced Python model for vortex
  nucleation and reversal in spherical magnetic nanoparticles. It provides
  optimized hyperbolic-vortex profiles, quasistatic hysteresis calculations,
  and Stoner-Wohlfarth reference calculations through a reusable package and
  browser-native interface.
keywords:
  - micromagnetics
  - magnetic nanoparticles
  - magnetic vortex
  - hysteresis
  - Stoner-Wohlfarth model
  - scientific software
